#. Diagram label
msgid "Sheet or issues changed?"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:37
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The agent thread that watches the log. Until the check says changed it only reads and runs the tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:68
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The tool's status. unchanged (exit 0): the poll ends and no agent work starts. changed (exit 10): its changes and the rows to append go on."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:51
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The watcher's poll: a chain of 3-minute delayed wakes, each queuing the next, with an hourly scheduled task that restarts the chain if it breaks (owner, 2026-11-01 10:20Z: \"instead of 1-minute lets do 3\")."
msgstr ""

